      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970818
    m_Localized: Half the damage, weaker bosses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970819
    m_Localized: More hostiles and no energy regeneration.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970820
    m_Localized: The campaign as it was meant to be flown.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
