    m_Localized: SUPPLIES
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970839
    m_Localized: EQUIPMENT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970840
    m_Localized: The Supply Room is closed during a mission and inside an online room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970841
    m_Localized: Topped up. Fly careful.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970842
    m_Localized: '{0} - ${1:N0}. Good hunting.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970843
    m_Localized: Credit's no good here, pilot. Come back with cash.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970844
    m_Localized: Your energy is full already.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970845
    m_Localized: You can't carry any more of those.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970846
    m_Localized: That's not for sale.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970847
    m_Localized: Your wallet is full, pilot. Spend some first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970848
    m_Localized: Sold for ${0:N0}. Pleasure doing business.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970849
    m_Localized: I only buy undamaged shields.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970850
    m_Localized: I can't buy that from you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970851
    m_Localized: Short on cash? Fly a mission and come back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970852
    m_Localized: Welcome back. Want that hull patched up?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970853
    m_Localized: Welcome back, pilot. What'll it be?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970854
    m_Localized: MG21 Reaver Machine Gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970855
    m_Localized: Twin wing guns. Every pilot flies with them and never loses them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970856
    m_Localized: Firestorm Plasma Cannon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970857
    m_Localized: A heavy centre bolt that burns through aircraft. Always on. Air only.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970858
    m_Localized: Micro-Missile Launcher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970859
    m_Localized: Pairs of small fast missiles at air and ground targets. Always on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970860
    m_Localized: DM1R Psycho Dumbfire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970861
    m_Localized: Missiles drop to the sides, then ignite and streak up. Air and ground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970862
    m_Localized: TH19 Thor Auto-Track Mini-Gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970863
    m_Localized: A rotary gun that tracks a random target on either layer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970864
    m_Localized: OD55 Odin Laser Turret
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970865
    m_Localized: Zaps a random aircraft on screen. Never misses. Air only.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970866
    m_Localized: AARL-1201 Missile Pods
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970867
    m_Localized: Very fast missile pairs that shred aircraft. Air only.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970868
    m_Localized: AIM-31 Mauler Air/Air Missiles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970869
    m_Localized: Pairs of missiles for aircraft. Air only.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970870
    m_Localized: AGM-26L Banshee Air/Ground Missiles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970871
    m_Localized: Slow heavy missiles that crack bunkers. Ground only.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970872
    m_Localized: MK-133 Bombs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970873
    m_Localized: Bombs that burst on the ground ahead of the ship. Ground only.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970874
    m_Localized: Power Disrupter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970875
    m_Localized: Withdrawn from service.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970876
    m_Localized: RX1 Tsunami Pulse Cannon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970877
    m_Localized: A wide shockwave that hits air and ground alike.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970878
    m_Localized: MSIL Atlas Deathray
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970879
    m_Localized: A beam from the nose to the first enemy in its path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970880
    m_Localized: CAL-10 Eclipse Twin Laser
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970881
    m_Localized: Two beams from the wing tips. The best money can buy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970882
    m_Localized: CBU-80 Guillotine Megabomb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970883
    m_Localized: Clears every enemy shot and hits everything on screen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970884
    m_Localized: Energy Module
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970885
    m_Localized: Restores up to 25 energy. Priced per point.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970886
    m_Localized: SA17 Ares Phase Shield
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970887
    m_Localized: Absorbs 100 damage before the energy is touched.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970888
    m_Localized: Ion Scanner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839970889
    m_Localized: Shows the health of the boss.
